# AgentKit Resources

## Protocol
Full protocol in `.claude/rules/02-protocol.mdc`.

## Execution Guidance
Use `.claude/rules/02-protocol.mdc` plus `.claude/skills/_registry.md` and `.claude/knowledge/_registry.md` as the maintained execution surface.
For maintainer work on `.claude/`, docs, tasks, or artifacts, classify the request first with `.claude/knowledge/focus_boundaries.md`.
Tracked agent-definition files are not part of the active framework.

## Skill Definitions
Read `.claude/skills/_registry.md` for available skills.
CHECK STATUS before invoking - "planned" skills are NOT implemented.

## Knowledge Base
Domain knowledge in `.claude/knowledge/*.md`.
Use `.claude/knowledge/focus_boundaries.md` when separating TP-AgentKit guidance from external-tooling guidance.

## Workflow Rules
Policies in `.claude/rules/workflows.md`.

## Trust Hierarchy
.claude/rules/ > .claude/knowledge/ > testprogram/ > .claude/artifacts/current_task/ > Online

Use task-local material in `.claude/artifacts/current_task/` as support context, not as a source of truth above inspected TP source.
